<aside class="affiliate-box" id="storage-marketplaces">
  <p class="eyebrow">Advertisement · Affiliate disclosure</p>
  <h2>Need a space someone already has, or a marketplace to compare units?</h2>
  <p><strong>Neighbor</strong> is a marketplace for reserving storage space, including unused rooms or pads listed by hosts. <strong>SpareFoot</strong> is a storage marketplace that compares traditional facilities. Until those programs issue a tracked link, the buttons below go to each company’s public website.</p>
  <p class="disclosure">{{ site.disclosure }}</p>
  <ul class="affiliate-links">
    {% for key, program in site.affiliates %}
    <li>
      <a class="button" href="{{ program | affiliateHref }}" {% if program | affiliateIsTracked %}rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"{% else %}rel="noopener"{% endif %} target="_blank">{{ program.name }}</a>
      {% if not (program | affiliateIsTracked) %}
      <span class="muted small">Public website — not a tracked affiliate link yet.</span>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</aside>
